Spec: Route markers

Purpose:
  Which endpoint markers a route gets, shared by the preview painter, the offline sketch and the live map.

Owns:
  ./route_markers.dart
  /test/domain/route_markers_test.dart

References:
  /docs/specs/history/07-map-system.md

Must:
  Endpoints at most 30 m apart, inclusive, get one combined start/finish marker; otherwise separate
    start and finish markers.
  Only the first and last point decide.
